#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:3966
msgctxt "tweak-ai"
msgid ""
"Autonomous ship behavior. Set orders (attack, defend, dock, etc.), target "
"entity, and target location for AI control.\n"
"\n"
"To issue movement, attack entity, dock with entity, or defend entity orders, "
"right-click on the target coordinates or entity while this entity is "
"selected. To issue other orders, select it from the Orders menu at the "
"bottom-right of the GM screen.\n"
"\n"
"This component can't be removed from an entity using the tweaks menu."
msgstr "Autonomous ship behaviour. Set orders (attack, defend, dock, etc.), target entity, and target location for AI control.\n\nTo issue movement, attack entity, dock with entity, or defend entity orders, right-click on the target coordinates or entity while this entity is selected. To issue other orders, select it from the Orders menu at the bottom-right of the GM screen.\n\nThis component can't be removed from an entity using the tweaks menu."

