"Defines simple orbital movement by this entity around another entity (orbit "
"target) or specified coordinates (orbit coordinates) at a defined distance "
"and period.\n"
"\n"
"Combine with Spin and Planet renderer to roughly simulate planetary rotation."
msgstr "Defines simple orbital movement by this entity around another entity (orbit target) or specified coordinates (orbit coordinates) at a defined distance and period.\n\nCombine with Spin and Planet renderer to roughly simulate planetary rotation."

