"A named region, typically visible on radar as a colored region with a label, "
"defined by a list of coordinates connected in order. Scripts can determine "
"whether an entity is within a Zone's bounds. Used for mission areas, hazard "
"zones, map regions, and special effects.\n"
"\n"
"A Zone can optionally change the skybox texture while within the zone, with "
"an optional transitional border to crossfade the skybox textures.\n"
"\n"
"triangles and zone_dirty are internal and can't be tweaked."
msgstr "A named region, typically visible on radar as a coloured region with a label, defined by a list of coordinates connected in order. Scripts can determine whether an entity is within a Zone's bounds. Used for mission areas, hazard zones, map regions, and special effects.\n\nA Zone can optionally change the skybox texture while within the zone, with an optional transitional border to crossfade the skybox textures.\n\ntriangles and zone_dirty are internal and can't be tweaked."

