msgctxt "tweak-moveto"
msgid ""
"Moves the entity to the target location in a straight line at a fixed rate "
"of speed. Used by default for probes instead of propulsion, and doesn't "
"apply AI avoidance behaviors.\n"
"\n"
"For AI-controlled entities, generally use propulsion components such as "
"Impulse engine and Maneuvering thrusters instead of Move to, then apply "
"movement orders by selecting this entity and right-clicking on the map.\n"
"\n"
"To effect orbital movement around a point or another entity, use the Orbit "
"component.\n"
"\n"
"Callback member on_arrival can't be tweaked via this dialog."
